error[E0277]: `There<u8>` has no index in `Count`
  --> tests/compile_fail/a_step_past_a_bare_type_is_not_a_position.rs:24:14
   |
24 |     let _ = <There<u8> as Position<Count>>::index();
   |              ^^^^^^^^^ the trait `Position<Count>` is not implemented for `There<u8>`
   |
   = note: A position is `Here`, or `There<P>` where `P` is itself a position, and the count `Count` has to implement `const Cardinal`: a plain `impl Cardinal` is not enough here, since the index is a constant. The trait is sealed through `Place`, so a marker of your own cannot become one. If the compiler reports `overflow evaluating the requirement` instead, the count is one step per cell and the position is further along than the default recursion limit, so the crate root wants `#![recursion_limit = "1024"]`.
